 "text": "Your goal isn't stuck because you're lazy, it's stuck because it has no date. Get fit or read more never asks anything of you today. There's no finish line so there's always more time. So rewrite it with a number and a date. Get fit becomes run 5k without stopping by December 31st. Now count back that's about 9 weeks away. So this week has a clear job 3 sessions of 20 minutes running and walking. Same with reading read more becomes 12 books by next October. That's one a month or about 10 pages a night. A goal without a date is just a wish. So pick one goal tonight give it a number and a date and you'll know exactly what this week is for. That's what Demure is for. You archive your dream today so you can see it tomorrow and break it down into small steps you can actually do. If you want to try it out I've put the link in the bio.",
